-- DB update 2026_09_10_06 -> 2026_09_10_07
-- Arcane Mage rework (docs/arcane-mage-rework-design.md) - Phase 3, Batch B.
-- .claude/skills/class-rework/SKILL.md Phase 3: 4 more "Deferred to Phase 3" clauses (see plan at
-- the time: ~/.claude/plans/twinkling-strolling-lagoon.md).
--
-- Data half: adds a SPELL_AURA_DUMMY marker effect (read live via the marker-aura-by-icon idiom) to
-- already-shipped Phase 2 talent rank spells, plus 5 new small buff/debuff spells the new
-- SpellScripts/AuraScripts below grant on proc:
--   Spell Power (4,0) capstone: rank 3 (200077) gets effect2 (marker, icon 2281, EFFECT_1) plus
--     native proc scaffolding (ProcTypeMask 65536 "done negative spell, magic dmg class" - same
--     flag real Presence of Mind uses; ProcChance 100; ProcCharges 0/unlimited) so the crit+mana
--     check in spell_mage_spell_power_capstone actually fires. New buff spell 200080 ("Spell
--     Power"): periodic 1%-max-mana/sec (snapshotted at proc time via CastCustomSpell, not a live
--     per-tick read) + flat +10% all-magic dmg + flat +5% additional Arcane dmg, 10s.
--   Improved Blink (4,2) capstone: rank 2 (31570) gets effect3 (marker, icon 1499, EFFECT_2). New
--     buff spell 200081 ("Improved Blink"): -20% all damage taken, 3s.
--   Improved Counterspell (3,1) capstone: rank 2 (12598) gets effect2 (marker, icon 17, EFFECT_1).
--     New debuff spell 200084 ("Improved Counterspell"): 2s silence, cast on Counterspell's target
--     rather than editing Counterspell's own row (so players without the talent aren't silenced).
--   Arcane Shielding (3,0): both ranks (11252, 12605) get effect2 (existence/rank marker only, icon
--     209, EFFECT_1 - the % lives on the two new buff spells instead). New buff spells 200082/200083
--     ("Arcane Shielding" rank 1/2): flat +5%/+10% all damage dealt, 10s.
--
-- C++ half (src/server/scripts/Spells/spell_mage.cpp) ships alongside this migration, not through
-- generate.py - see that diff. No talent_dbc changes this batch - none of the 4 talents' own
-- tier/column/rank_spell_ids changed, only their spell rows' effect slots.
--
-- generate.py clean (zero lint WARNINGs). codestyle-cpp.py clean on spell_mage.cpp (repo-wide
-- pre-existing findings elsewhere are unrelated). test_sql_dump.py + manual balanced-statement scan
-- clean - codestyle-sql.py itself can't run in this sandbox (no network for git fetch), same
-- accepted limitation as every prior batch.

DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (11252, 12598, 12605, 31570, 200077, 200080, 200081, 200082, 200083, 200084);
